		link: { href: CAMPAIGN_URL, label: 'Learn more →' },
	},
	{
		q: 'Why is the Father’s Heart Bible™ thicker than other bibles?',
		a: `Two reasons, and both are honest ones. A complete Bible in readable type runs 876 pages here, and print-on-demand uses a premium, heavier white paper — the thin, opaque bible paper you know from other editions comes from offset printing at volume, which we will move to in future. Slimmer thinline editions will follow.`,
